Which person are you: the person on the **left** or the **right**?"},{"role":"user","text":"I'm the woman with short blonde hair on the right. I'd like it to look natural and professional, and please keep my smile. I don't have a particular platform in mind; square at 640 × 640 would be fine."}],"attachments":[{"name":"two-friends.jpg","kind":"image","role":"person"}],"tool":"edit_image","params":[{"name":"subject","value":"The woman with short blonde hair on the right","source":"user"},{"name":"edit","value":"Create a professional headshot of the woman only","source":"derived"},{"name":"keep","value":"Her recognizable facial features, short blonde hair, and smile","source":"user"},{"name":"aspect","value":"1:1","source":"user"},{"name":"look","value":"Natural and professional, 640 × 640 pixels","source":"user"}]}
